OSINT PRACTICAL EXAM — SET 1
PRACTICAL CHEAT SHEET AND THEORY WRITING GUIDE

Five Experiments:
1. Google Dorks and News Verification
2. Reverse Image Search and Geolocation
3. Website Crawling / URL Discovery
4. Competitor Analysis
5. Company OSINT Investigation

PAPER-WRITING FORMAT REQUIRED BY FACULTY
- Background / Theory: 50–100 words
- Suitable open-source tool: around 50 words
- Performance steps
- Conclusion / Result

IMPORTANT
