3. Enter the NDTV URL in Wayback Machine.

4. Inspect available historical snapshots.

5. Record results and dates.

6. Use a dedicated crawler if a complete internal URL list is required.


CONCLUSION

Relevant URLs were discovered and archived versions were checked where available. A dedicated crawler can be used when a complete internal-link list is required.



